OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright or sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers, these mainly in the
OL,7,Fwest. Drier across the east. Showers
OL,8,Fbecoming more frequent in the west
OL,9,Flater. Strong southwesterly winds in
OL,10,Fthe northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Becoming drier
OL,14,Fovernight with showers becoming
OL,15,Fconfined to the far northwest. Strong
OL,16,Fsouth or southwesterly winds in the
OL,17,Fnorthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
