OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,7,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,8,Fwill spread from the west by evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA few
OL,11,Fshowers in the northwest on Monday,
OL,12,Fmainly dry in the east. Windy and
OL,13,Fmainly dry on Tuesday, rain spreading
OL,14,Feast later. Bright with showers
OL,15,FWednesday.
